#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:1
msgid "Skill 编写指南"
msgstr "Skill Authoring Guide"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:3
msgid "先让一个最小技能被发现并产生可检查的文件，再增加脚本、依赖与 hook。"
msgstr ""
"First make a minimal skill discoverable and produce an inspectable file, then add "
"scripts, dependencies and hooks."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "本页保留从零编写技能的最短流程。发现、激活、脚本执行与 hook 契约统一维护在 {doc}`agent_skills`，避免两份说明随实现变化而不一致。"
msgstr ""
"This page keeps the shortest path to authoring a skill. Discovery, activation, script"
" execution and hook contracts are maintained in {doc}`agent_skills` to keep "
"implementation details consistent."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:7
msgid "创建最小技能"
msgstr "Create a Minimal Skill"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:9
msgid "在研究工作区创建目录："
msgstr "Create a directory in the research workspace:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:11
msgid ""
"custom/skills/social-reflection/\n"
"└── SKILL.md\n"
msgstr ""
"custom/skills/social-reflection/\n"
"└── SKILL.md\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:16
msgid "`SKILL.md` 同时包含用于发现的元数据和激活后读取的行为说明："
msgstr ""
"`SKILL.md` contains both discovery metadata and the instructions read after "
"activation:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:18
msgid ""
"---\n"
"name: social-reflection\n"
"description: Reflect on a recent social interaction and record a short explanation.\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"# Social Reflection\n"
"\n"
"## When to use\n"
"After a meaningful social interaction.\n"
"\n"
"## Inputs\n"
"Use the current step context. Read state/relationships.json if it exists.\n"
"\n"
"## Steps\n"
"1. Read the available relationship state; use an empty state if the file is absent.\n"
"2. Explain how the interaction may change trust, using evidence from the current step.\n"
"3. Write a short reflection to state/social_reflection.json.\n"
"\n"
"## Outputs\n"
"state/social_reflection.json, containing reflection and supporting evidence.\n"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"name: social-reflection\n"
"description: Reflect on a recent social interaction and record a short explanation.\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"# Social Reflection\n"
"\n"
"## When to use\n"
"After a meaningful social interaction.\n"
"\n"
"## Inputs\n"
"Use the current step context. Read state/relationships.json if it exists.\n"
"\n"
"## Steps\n"
"1. Read the available relationship state; use an empty state if the file is absent.\n"
"2. Explain how the interaction may change trust, using evidence from the current step.\n"
"3. Write a short reflection to state/social_reflection.json.\n"
"\n"
"## Outputs\n"
"state/social_reflection.json, containing reflection and supporting evidence.\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:41
msgid "在工作台的“技能管理 → 运行时”扫描工作区。技能出现在目录中后，由智能体在运行时按需激活；目录可见不代表已经执行。"
msgstr ""
"Scan the workspace under Skill Management → Runtime. Once discovered, the skill can "
"be activated by an agent as needed; appearing in the catalog does not mean it has "
"run."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:43
msgid "何时添加脚本"
msgstr "When to Add a Script"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"确定性计算、格式转换和数据校验适合脚本；开放判断可先使用纯提示技能。脚本的 `entrypoint(argv, "
"ctx)`、`ctx.workspace_root`、返回值和超时规则见 {doc}`agent_skills`，API 见 {doc}`api/skills`。"
msgstr ""
"Scripts suit deterministic calculations, format conversion and data validation; start"
" with prompt-only skills for open-ended judgments. See {doc}`agent_skills` for "
"`entrypoint(argv, ctx)`, `ctx.workspace_root`, return values and timeouts, and "
"{doc}`api/skills` for the API."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:47
msgid ""
"`SKILL.md` 只声明受支持的 `name`、`description`、可选 `script` 与 "
"`hooks`。依赖、输入、输出和环境交互步骤写在正文中，不添加没有解析器支持的配置字段。"
msgstr ""
"Only declare supported `name`, `description`, optional `script` and `hooks` fields in"
" `SKILL.md`. Put dependencies, inputs, outputs and environment interactions in the "
"body rather than inventing configuration fields."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:49
msgid "检查与调试"
msgstr "Check and Debug"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:51
msgid "用独立测试工作区放置输入，检查缺失输入和重复执行时的行为。"
msgstr ""
"Use a separate test workspace with sample inputs, and check missing inputs and "
"repeated execution."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:52
msgid "对照实际工具名编写步骤；与环境交互使用 `ask_env`。"
msgstr ""
"Use actual tool names in the instructions; interact with the environment through "
"`ask_env`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:53
msgid "检查输出文件与 `<run_dir>/trace/trace_*.jsonl`，区分“技能被发现”“技能被激活”和“脚本已完成”。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect output files and `<run_dir>/trace/trace_*.jsonl`, distinguishing discovery, "
"activation and completed script execution."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skill_guide.md:54
msgid "需要维护运行时或内置技能时，阅读源码中的 `agentsociety2/agent/skills/README.md`。"
msgstr ""
"For runtime or built-in skill maintenance, read "
"`agentsociety2/agent/skills/README.md` in the source tree."
